# Chapter 1: The Network Awakening

{#p_001} The electronic mist was slowly advancing over the Marble of the city, saturating atmospheric sensors with data residues.

{#p_002} In the shadow of the routing station, two silhouettes were waiting for the sub-distribution frame to be completely reset.

- [Marc] Is the conversion script finally ready?
- [Lucie] Almost, the block compilation is underway. The primary node should validate the transaction within a few seconds.

{#p_003} A sharp beep broke the silence. Lucie pointed her terminal toward the central console^[note_001]. The indicator lights shifted to a synchronous green.

---
# Notes Registry
^[note_001]: Third-generation Grid-Flex console, optimized for zero-latency raw data stream reading.
